= Kevin Zagalo


Assistant professor in the telecommunication department of INSA Lyon. I do my research in the [https://team.inria.fr/maracas/ Maracas] team of Inria Lyon hosted in the [https://www.citi-lab.fr/ CITI] laboratory.\nI currently work on latency-focused analyses of random wireless networks based on stochastic geometry approaches. I also host the [https://team.inria.fr/maracas/seminar/ MARACAS seminar].

=== Research interests
- Real-time scheduling
- Random wireless networks


